5. WHAT THIS ROUND DID **NOT** RE-MEASURE
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Stated so the record is not read as broader than it is.

- The implementer's Measurements 1-6 (the one-line-needle probe, main's suite
  file, main's suite + main's validator, the 24-suite advance, the whole-repository
  merge simulation, and the union-registry rerun that reached 62 suites green)
  were NOT reproduced in this round. They are recorded in the committed E1..E9
  artifacts and were independently checked by the seq0372 evaluator. This chain
  re-measures only the two aborts themselves and their non-attribution.
- Consequently, the claim "the bash lane's abort chain is entirely
  merge-resolvable" is carried forward from those artifacts, not re-derived here.
  It remains a simulation result, not the merge.
- The pwsh lane beyond suite 1 is unmeasured on this branch, in this round and in
  the implementer's.
- The three adjacent guard suites that T-009..T-012's chains carried as a
  SUPPLEMENTARY section (phase2-guard-invariants, guard-staging-exemption, guards)
